 ## [Unreleased]
 
+## [0.4.0] - 2026-10-20
+
+### Added
+
+- Tool input validation against `inputSchema`. The registry now validates tool inputs using JSON Schema before execution. Malformed calls from the model are rejected with a descriptive error message returned to the model rather than throwing, allowing the model to correct the call within the turn.
+
+### Changed
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` now returns a rejection `ToolResponse` for invalid input instead of calling the executor.
+- Static tool schemas are compiled once at registration time.
+
